{
  "parse": {
    "title": "Trading",
    "pageid": 13246,
    "revid": 831514,
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Trading</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Emerald.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Emerald.png\"><img alt=\"Emerald.png\" src=\"/images/Emerald.png?c1511\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div></div>\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">For the feature that lets you trade items and coins for other pre-made items in the SkyBlock Menu, see <a href=\"/w/Trades\" title=\"Trades\">Trades</a>.</div>\n<p><b>Trading</b> is a feature that allows players to trade items and <span><a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span> with each other.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Overview\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Overview</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Initiating_a_Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Initiating a Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Tradeable_Items\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tradeable Items</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trading_Coins\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trading Coins</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Restrictions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Restrictions</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#UI\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">UI</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Overview\">Overview</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Trading?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Overview\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Trading?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Overview\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Initiating_a_Trade\">Initiating a Trade</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Trading?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Initiating a Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Trading?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Initiating a Trade\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>To initiate a trade with another player, the player can either:\n</p>\n<ul><li>use the <span class=\"code\">/trade &lt;player&gt;</span> command;</li>\n<li>interact with the person they wish to trade with through <kbd class=\"keypress-diagram\"><span class=\"unicode\">⇧</span> Shift</kbd> + <kbd class=\"keypress-diagram\">Right Click</kbd>;</li>\n<li>or click on the <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/images/thumb/Emerald.png/21px-Emerald.png?c1511\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Emerald.png/42px-Emerald.png?c1511 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></span></span>&#160;Emerald in their profile menu, which will initiate a trade request.</li></ul>\n<p>The recipient will receive the following message in chat:\n</p>\n<div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-a\">&lt;username&gt; has sent you a trade request. </span><span class=\"format-b\">Click here </span><span class=\"format-a\">to accept!</span></div></div>\n<p>The maximum distance you can trade from is <span class=\"light-color color-green\">9</span> blocks.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Tradeable_Items\">Tradeable Items</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Trading?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Tradeable Items\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Trading?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Tradeable Items\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Almost all items can be traded, alongside a given lump-sum of <span><a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span>. Some items that cannot be put up for auction on the <a href=\"/w/Auction_House\" title=\"Auction House\">Auction House</a>, such as <a href=\"/w/Minions\" title=\"Minions\">Minions</a> and certain items from <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Anita\" title=\"Anita\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Anita in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Anita_Sprite.png/16px-Anita_Sprite.png?8f448\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Anita_Sprite.png/32px-Anita_Sprite.png?8f448 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"272\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Anita\" title=\"Anita\">Anita</a>, can be traded; other items cannot be auctioned or traded at all, such as <a href=\"/w/Sacks\" title=\"Sacks\">Sacks</a>.\n</p><p>Items that are <a href=\"/w/Soulbound\" title=\"Soulbound\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\"> Soulbound</span></a> cannot be traded at all, and items that are <a href=\"/w/Soulbound\" title=\"Soulbound\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;gray\">Co-op Soulbound</span></a> cannot be traded with players outside of the player's <a href=\"/w/Co-op\" title=\"Co-op\">Co-op</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Trading_Coins\">Trading Coins</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Trading?section=4&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Trading Coins\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Trading?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trading Coins\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>A given lump-sum of <span><a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span> can be traded in the Trading menu. Players under <a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Levels\" title=\"SkyBlock Levels\"><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">SkyBlock Level 50</span></a> have a daily trading limit of  <span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\"><span>50,000,000</span></span> <a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span> players above <a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Levels\" title=\"SkyBlock Levels\"><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">SkyBlock Level 50</span></a> have a limit of <span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\"><span>1,000,000,000</span></span> <a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span>, and players above <a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Levels\" title=\"SkyBlock Levels\"><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\">SkyBlock Level 100</span></a> have a limit of <span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\"><span>10,000,000,000</span></span> <a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span>.\n</p><p>Different icons in the Trading menu show different amounts of <span><a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Coins.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Coins.png/21px-Coins.png?72609\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Coins.png/42px-Coins.png?72609 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span> represents <span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\"><span>1–99,999</span></span> <a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span>;</li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Coin_Tier_2.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Coin_Tier_2.png/21px-Coin_Tier_2.png?c6877\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Coin_Tier_2.png/42px-Coin_Tier_2.png?c6877 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span> represents <span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\"><span>100,000–9,999,999</span></span> <a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span>;</li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Coins_(Lapis).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Coins_%28Lapis%29.png/21px-Coins_%28Lapis%29.png?b2aed\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Coins_%28Lapis%29.png/42px-Coins_%28Lapis%29.png?b2aed 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span> represents <span class=\"color-gold\">≥</span><span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\"><span>10,000,000</span></span> <a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Restrictions\">Restrictions</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Trading?section=5&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Restrictions\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Trading?action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Restrictions\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p><a href=\"/w/Ironman\" title=\"Ironman\"><span class=\"color-gray\">♻ Ironman</span></a>, <a href=\"/w/Stranded\" title=\"Stranded\"><span class=\"light-color color-green\">☀ Stranded</span></a>, and <a href=\"/w/Bingo\" title=\"Bingo\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;purple\">Ⓑ Bingo</span></a> players are explicitly restricted from trading. Additionally, players using a nickname cannot trade with anyone other than players with the <span style=\"display:inline;font-size:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\" class=\"mcui-text\"><span class=\"desktop-hide hidden noexcerpt\">55</span><a href=\"/w/Ranks#staff\" title=\"Ranks\"><span class=\"format-c\">&#91;</span><span class=\"format-6\">ዞ</span><span class=\"format-c\">&#93;</span></a></span> rank.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"UI\">UI</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Trading?section=6&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: UI\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Trading?action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: UI\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mcui mcui-Chest\"><div class=\"mcui-header\">You‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎&lt;Username&gt;</div><div class=\"mcui-row\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"common\" data-minetip-text=\"\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Black Stained Glass Pane.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png/32px-Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png?8d29b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png/64px-Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png?8d29b 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></span></span></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span></div><div class=\"mcui-row\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"common\" data-minetip-text=\"\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Black Stained Glass Pane.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png/32px-Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png?8d29b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png/64px-Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png?8d29b 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></span></span></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span></div><div class=\"mcui-row\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"common\" data-minetip-text=\"\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Black Stained Glass Pane.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png/32px-Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png?8d29b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png/64px-Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png?8d29b 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></span></span></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span></div><div class=\"mcui-row\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"common\" data-minetip-text=\"\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Black Stained Glass Pane.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png/32px-Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png?8d29b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png/64px-Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png?8d29b 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></span></span></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span></div><div class=\"mcui-row\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"common\" data-minetip-text=\"\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Black Stained Glass Pane.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png/32px-Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png?8d29b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png/64px-Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png?8d29b 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></span></span></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span></div><div class=\"mcui-row\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;6Coins Transaction\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;e/&amp;7Daily limit: &amp;a0&amp;7\\/50M&amp;7//&amp;eClick to add gold!\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Coins Transaction\"><img alt=\"Coins.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Coins.png/32px-Coins.png?72609\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Coins.png/64px-Coins.png?72609 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;eDeal!\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;7All trades are final and/&amp;7cannot be reverted.//&amp;aMake sure to review the/&amp;atrade before accepting.//&amp;eClick to accept the trade!\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Deal!\"><img alt=\"Green Terracotta.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Green_Terracotta.png/32px-Green_Terracotta.png?b901a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Green_Terracotta.png/64px-Green_Terracotta.png?b901a 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"common\" data-minetip-text=\"\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Black Stained Glass Pane.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png/32px-Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png?8d29b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png/64px-Black_Stained_Glass_Pane.png?8d29b 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></span></span></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"common\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;eNew deal\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;7Trading with &lt;username&gt;.\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"New deal\"><img alt=\"Gray Dye.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Gray_Dye.png/32px-Gray_Dye.png?4ac52\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Gray_Dye.png/64px-Gray_Dye.png?4ac52 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></span></span></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item\"></span></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Trading?section=7&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Trading?action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>The first time a player completes a trade, they will get the <a href=\"/w/Achievements#Businessman\" title=\"Achievements\">Businessman</a> achievement.</li>\n<li>Accepting a trade request in the <a href=\"/w/Rift_Dimension\" title=\"Rift Dimension\">Rift Dimension</a> results in the players swapping (\"trading\") places rather than trading items, unless they are in the same <a href=\"/w/Co-op\" title=\"Co-op\">Co-op</a>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Trading?section=8&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Trading?action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: History\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable pixelated\" data-description=\"History\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Prototype\" title=\"SkyBlock Prototype\">SkyBlock Prototype</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2019/September_11\" title=\"Changelog/2019/September 11\">Sep&#160;11,&#160;2019</a></th><th rowspan=\"1\">0.7.1</th><td>Added <b>Trading</b>.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://hypixel.net/threads/trade-with-coins-incoming.2513395/\">Dec&#160;24,&#160;2019</a></th><td>Minikloon teases Trading functionality with coins support.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://i.badlion.net/2hgfhkTFjb5PXkojBip7df.png/\">Feb&#160;21,&#160;2020</a></th><th rowspan=\"1\">0.7.6</th><td>Coin Trading added.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"5\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2020/July_17\" title=\"Changelog/2020/July 17\">Jul&#160;17,&#160;2020</a></th><td>Increased trade inventory size from 12 to 16.</td></tr><tr><td>Increased coin trade limit from <span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\"><span>50,000,000</span></span> <a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span> to <span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\"><span>1,000,000,000</span></span> <a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span></td></tr><tr><td>Specified amounts of coins with decimals no longer round down.</td></tr><tr><td>Removed trade restrictions from accounts with more than 50 hours of SkyBlock play time and at least lvl 15 skill average.</td></tr><tr><td>Total amount of coins offered in a trade now shows on lump sums.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"2\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2021/August_13\" title=\"Changelog/2021/August 13\">Aug&#160;13,&#160;2021</a></th><td>Items can no longer be dropped to players</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"/w/Jacob%27s_Farming_Contest\" title=\"Jacob&#39;s Farming Contest\">Jacob's Farming Contest</a> items can now be traded.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2021/November_8\" title=\"Changelog/2021/November 8\">Nov&#160;8,&#160;2021</a></th><td>Changed coins icon from <a href=\"/w/Gold_Nugget\" title=\"Gold Nugget\">Gold Nuggets</a> to head icons.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2023/July_12\" title=\"Changelog/2023/July 12\">Jul&#160;12,&#160;2023</a></th><th rowspan=\"2\">0.19.1</th><td>Added a new highest visual coin tier.</td></tr><tr><td>Decreased coin trade limit to <span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\"><span>50,000,000</span></span> <a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Coins</span></a></span> per day, which can be increased at certain <a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Levels\" title=\"SkyBlock Levels\">SkyBlock Levels</a>.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mediawiki‐jobrunner‐847db4cdb‐djfzh\nCached time: 20261023051152\nCache expiry: 172800\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 1.378 seconds\nReal time usage: 2.756 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 564/1000000\nRevision size: 3590/8388608 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 30755/8388608 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4232/8388608 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\